{
  "id": "p1-fem",
  "name": {
    "ja": "連続P1 Galerkin有限要素法",
    "en": "Continuous P1 Galerkin FEM"
  },
  "group": {
    "id": "space",
    "ja": "空間離散化",
    "en": "Spatial discretization"
  },
  "summary": {
    "ja": "Poisson方程式の弱形式を、連続区分線形要素で離散化する。公開例は1次元区間と単位正方形の三角形分割で、剛性・整合質量行列を組み立て、非零Dirichlet値も消去できる。",
    "en": "Discretize the weak Poisson problem with continuous piecewise-linear elements. The examples assemble stiffness/consistent-mass matrices on an interval and a triangulated unit square, including nonzero Dirichlet elimination."
  },
  "status": "educational-example",
  "origin": "existing-coverage-catalog",
  "reading": {
    "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/ja/read/fem/",
    "en": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/en/read/fem/"
  },
  "code_modules": [
    "fem"
  ],
  "test_files": [
    "test_sparse_fem"
  ],
  "code_mapping_scope": "Scoped fixed-input examples; original method variants and earlier releases remain distinct.",
  "references": [
    {
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1090/S0002-9904-1943-07818-4",
      "label": "Courant, R. (1943). Variational methods for the solution of problems of equilibrium and vibrations.",
      "scope": "Piecewise-linear trial functions on triangular subdivisions in a variational formulation; not a source for the atlas's CSR or GMRES implementation.",
      "role": "formulation",
      "kind": "primary-research",
      "supports": {
        "ja": "三角形分割上の区分線形関数による変分近似を根拠付ける。現代的な疎行列・線形解法の出典とは区別する。",
        "en": "Supports triangular piecewise-linear variational approximation, separately from the modern sparse solver implementation."
      },
      "verification": {
        "checked_on": "2026-11-22",
        "level": "full-text",
        "url": "https://web.stanford.edu/class/cme324/classics/courant.pdf",
        "locator": "Section III, paragraph on linear functions on triangles, PDF p. 15 (reprint printed p. 2179); primary-paper reprint."
      },
      "bibliography_id": "courant1943"
    }
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Approximate constant-coefficient −Δu=f by continuous P1 Galerkin elements: uniform intervals on [0,1] or affine triangles from diagonally split unit-square cells.",
    "Element formulas assemble stiffness and consistent mass; forcing uses four-point Gauss quadrature in 1D and product Gauss quadrature under a Duffy transform on triangles.",
    "Dirichlet rows/columns are symmetrically eliminated and the system is solved by ILU(0)-preconditioned GMRES; smooth manufactured solutions support L2/H1 error evaluation."
  ],
  "units": "Examples use dimensionless unit-length domains. With physical scaling, [f]=[u]/L²; stiffness and mass have geometric scales L^(d−2) and L^d in dimension d.",
  "boundary_conditions": "Dirichlet data apply at both interval endpoints or the full unit-square perimeter; defaults are zero and callbacks allow nonzero data. This example does not assemble Neumann/Robin boundary integrals.",
  "limitations": {
    "ja": "汎用メッシュ生成や曲線要素、可変係数、混合要素の実装ではない。L2で2次・H1半ノルムで1次という既存の検査は滑らかな製造解と本メッシュの範囲であり、角の特異性や任意領域へ無条件に一般化しない。",
    "en": "Not a general mesh generator or implementation of curved elements, variable coefficients or mixed elements. Existing second-order L2 and first-order H1-seminorm tests concern smooth manufactured solutions on these meshes; do not generalize them unconditionally to corner singularities or arbitrary domains."
  },
  "metadata_review": {
    "level": "method-specific sources and implementation inspected; no new numerical rerun",
    "on": "2026-11-22"
  },
  "assumptions_ja": [
    "定係数の −Δu=f を連続P1 Galerkin空間で近似する。1次元は [0,1] の一様区間、2次元は単位正方形を対角分割したアフィン三角形。",
    "剛性・整合質量行列は要素公式を使う。右辺は1次元4点Gauss求積、三角形はDuffy変換の積Gauss求積で評価する。",
    "Dirichletの行と列を対称に消去し、ILU(0)付きGMRESで解く。滑らかな製造解のL2/H1誤差評価を備える。"
  ],
  "units_ja": "公開例は無次元の長さ1の領域。物理尺度を付けるなら [f]=[u]/L²、次元dの剛性行列はL^(d−2)、質量行列はL^dの幾何学的尺度を持つ。",
  "boundary_conditions_ja": "区間の両端、または単位正方形の全外周にDirichlet値を指定する。標準値は零で、関数により非零値も指定できる。Neumann/Robin境界積分は本例では組み立てない。",
